\"Member\",\"designation\":\"Designation\",\"phoneNumber2\":\"Phone Number 2\",\"faxNumber\":\"Fax Number\",\"previousChats\":\"Previous Chats\",\"searchChats\":\"Search chats...\",\"loadingChatHistory\":\"Loading chat history...\",\"noPreviousChatsFound\":\"No previous chats found. Start your first conversation!\",\"noChatsMatchSearch\":\"No chats match your search.\",\"newChat\":\"New Chat\",\"failedToLoadChatHistory\":\"Failed to load chat history\",\"heroTitle\":\"Our Family Is Your Family\",\"heroSubtitle\":\"Your Peace Of Mind In Every Decision We Make.\",\"heroDescription\":\"Join thousands of insulators gaining annual raises, professional representation, and the collective strength you deserve.\",\"jiJoinUsToday\":\"Join Us Today\",\"jiJoinToday\":\"Join Today!\",\"buildYourFuture\":\"Build Your Future\",\"joinTheInsulators\":\"JOIN THE INSULATORS\",\"unionToday\":\"UNION TODAY!\",\"joinDescription\":\"Discover a rewarding career in mechanical insulation with great pay and even better benefits for experienced construction workers like you.\",\"videoTitle\":\"See Our Union In Action\",\"videoSubtitle\":\"Watch how we support our members through training, representation, and building a stronger community together.\",\"videoCtaTitle\":\"Ready to start your career with Insulators International?\",\"videoCtaDescription\":\"Join a union that fights for you — steady work, elite training, real wages.\",\"videoPlaylistLabel\":\"PLAYLIST\",\"videoVideosLabel\":\"videos\",\"visionTitle\":\"Our Vision\",\"visionDescription\":\"We aim to transform you to a rewarding career with the IAHFIAW by equipping skilled workers with specialized Insulation training ensuring high-quality craftsmanship and safety, ultimately leading to a sustainable future in a trade in high demand.\",\"benefitsTitle\":\"Benefits Of Membership\",\"benefitsDescription\":\"Joining the Insulators Union provides competitive wages and minimal to no deductions for premium health insurance, along with unparalleled retirement benefits. Additionally, you can enjoy yearly pay raises that are negotiated on your behalf, ensuring that the best interests of our members are always prioritized.\",\"trainingTitle\":\"Training Program\",\"trainingDescription\":\"Our hands-on training programs equip you with essential skills in insulation, preparing you for a rewarding career with competitive pay and benefits. Join us to enhance your expertise and secure your future.\",\"successTitle\":\"Success Stories\",\"successDescription\":\"Our members have found remarkable values in their new career with IAHFIAW. Hear firsthand how joining the Insulators Union has opened doors to new opportunities and improved lives.\",\"successClickHint\":\"Click any portrait to read their story\",\"successPrevAriaLabel\":\"Previous story\",\"successNextAriaLabel\":\"Next story\",\"successCloseAriaLabel\":\"Close story\",\"payBenefitsTitle\":\"Great Pay \u0026 Benefits\",\"payBenefitsDescription\":\"Join the Insulators Union to unlock your potential with competitive pay and comprehensive benefits. Invest in your future while gaining valuable skills in a high-demand field that reward dedication and hard work.\",\"careerGrowthTitle\":\"Career Growth\",\"careerGrowthDescription\":\"Join our Insulators Union to unlock potential for career advancement. With training and support, skilled workers can achieve new heights in their profession, enjoying greater pay and job satisfaction.\",\"ctaTitle\":\"Join Us Today\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Become a valued member of our Insulators Union, where you'll find a welcoming community of members and contractors ready to support your career transition into an exciting and rewarding field with excellent pay and benefits.\",\"jiMemberLogin\":\"Member Login\",\"jiCopyright\":\"© 2024 International Association of Heat and Frost Insulators and Allied Workers. All rights reserved.\",\"jiMetaTitle\":\"Insulators International\",\"jiMetaDescription\":\"International Association of Heat \u0026 Frost Insulators and Allied Workers\",\"jiHeaderLogoAlt\":\"International Association of Heat \u0026 Frost Insulators Logo\",\"jiVisionImage1Alt\":\"Union vision\",\"jiVisionImage2Alt\":\"Union work\",\"jiBenefitsImageAlt\":\"Union worker on site\",\"jiTrainingImage1Alt\":\"Training program\",\"jiTrainingImage2Alt\":\"Hands-on training\",\"jiPayBenefitsLogoAlt\":\"IAHFIAW Logo\",\"jiCareerImage1Alt\":\"Career growth opportunities\",\"jiCareerImage2Alt\":\"Professional development\",\"jiVideoViews\":\"{views} views\",\"jiReadStoryAriaLabel\":\"Read {name}'s story\",\"jiStoryRoleJohnHoey\":\"Membership Development Representative, NY/NE Conference\",\"jiStoryRoleKaitlynLambert\":\"Journeyperson\",\"jiStoryRoleTaraMinnich\":\"Membership Development Representative, Middle Atlantic States Conference\",\"jiStoryRoleAngelSoto\":\"Membership Development Representative\",\"jiStoryRoleEloRodriguez\":\"Organizer\",\"jiStoryRoleDavidKnipp\":\"Member \u0026 Influencer @ Proud Union Guy\",\"jiStoryRoleDavidChudzinski\":\"Organizer/President\",\"jiStoryRoleDanPoteet\":\"Business Manager\",\"jiFooterLogoAlt\":\"Insulators Union Logo\",\"jiFollowUsOnSocial\":\"Follow Us On Social\",\"jiSocialAriaLabel\":\"Visit us on {network}\",\"jiWebsiteBy\":\"Website by\",\"jiPrivacyPolicy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"jiCookiePolicy\":\"Cookie Policy\",\"jiContactUs\":\"Contact Us\",\"jiApprenticeshipNudgeTitle\":\"Looks like you might be new to the trade!\",\"jiApprenticeshipNudgeBody\":\"With 0–1 years of experience, you may be a great fit for our apprenticeship program.\",\"jiApprenticeshipNudgeCta\":\"Explore Apprenticeships\",\"l87NavJoinToday\":\"JOIN TODAY\",\"l87JoinUsToday\":\"JOIN US TODAY\",\"l87JoinToday\":\"JOIN TODAY\",\"l87SeeTheBenefits\":\"SEE THE BENEFITS\",\"l87VisitInsulators\":\"VISIT INSULATORS\",\"l87HeroTag\":\"LOCAL 87 - AUSTIN \u0026 SAN ANTONIO, TX\",\"l87HeroTitle1\":\"Central Texas\",\"l87HeroTitle2\":\"Is Hiring.\",\"l87HeroSubtitle\":\"YOUR FAMILY IS OUR FAMILY\",\"l87HeroDescription\":\"The biggest construction boom in Central Texas history is happening right now. Heat \u0026 Frost Insulators Local 87 is ready to put you to work — with union wages, full benefits, and a brotherhood that has your back.\",\"l87Stat1Label\":\"OPENINGS IN CENTRAL TEXAS\",\"l87Stat2Label\":\"YEARS OF STEADY WORK AHEAD\",\"l87Stat3Label\":\"OUT-OF-POCKET FOR BENEFITS\",\"l87Stat4Label\":\"UNION CONTRACTORS IN REGION\",\"l87WorkLabel\":\"THE WORK IS HERE\",\"l87WorkTitle\":\"Plenty of Work for Insulators in Central Texas.\",\"l87WorkBody1\":\"From Austin to San Antonio and beyond, Central Texas is in the middle of an unprecedented construction surge. Data centers, semiconductor facilities, space technology campuses, and manufacturing projects are creating more insulation work than the region has seen in decades.\",\"l87WorkBody2\":\"Local 87 members are already on projects at Samsung, AMD, Motorola, Intel, and SpaceX in Bastrop — with major work continuing to ramp up across the metro and heading south toward Corpus Christi. Our local contractors have been busy before, but not like this.\",\"l87WorkBody3\":\"Once the projects are built, our members stay on for maintenance contracts — meaning the work keeps coming year after year. Samsung, AMD, and Motorola are proof of it.\",\"l87WorkBullet1Title\":\"Data Centers \u0026 Tech Campuses\",\"l87WorkBullet1Body\":\"Samsung, Intel, AMD, and more are driving massive insulation demand across the Austin metro, with long-term maintenance work to follow.\",\"l87WorkBullet2Title\":\"SpaceX Bastrop \u0026 Beyond\",\"l87WorkBullet2Body\":\"SpaceX's expanding campus in the Bastrop corridor is one of several high-profile projects where Local 87 members are already on the job.\",\"l87WorkBullet3Title\":\"San Antonio \u0026 South Texas\",\"l87WorkBullet3Body\":\"San Antonio work is picking up fast, with opportunities extending south through Corpus Christi and into the Rio Grande Valley.\",\"l87WorkBullet4Title\":\"Projects Turn Into Maintenance\",\"l87WorkBullet4Body\":\"Members at Samsung, AMD, and Motorola have been on steady maintenance since those original projects wrapped. This work doesn't just end.\",\"l87BenefitsLabel\":\"WHAT YOU GET\",\"l87BenefitsTitle\":\"Real Benefits. Zero Deductions.\",\"l87BenefitsBody\":\"Nothing comes out of your paycheck for health care. Your wages are negotiated so you know exactly what you're making. Your union reps go to bat for you every year — no haggling, no going it alone.\",\"l87Benefit1Title\":\"Top Union Wages\",\"l87Benefit1Body\":\"Union wages in Central Texas are among the best in the trade. You know what you're making before you step on the job — negotiated for you, every year.\",\"l87Benefit2Title\":\"Full Health Coverage\",\"l87Benefit2Body\":\"Medical, dental, and optical — covered. Nothing comes out of your paycheck. Your benefits are provided by your union. That's the deal.\",\"l87Benefit3Title\":\"Pension \u0026 Retirement\",\"l87Benefit3Body\":\"Local 87 members build toward a real pension and retirement security. Work hard now, and there's a real light at the end of the tunnel.\",\"l87Benefit4Title\":\"Steady, Guaranteed Work\",\"l87Benefit4Body\":\"With 20+ union contractors in the region, when one job ends, we refer you to the next. Consistent wages and benefits throughout your career.\",\"l87Benefit5Title\":\"Union Representation\",\"l87Benefit5Body\":\"Your union reps negotiate raises, protect your rights, and set you up for the next project. You always have someone in your corner.\",\"l87Benefit6Title\":\"Safety Is a Promise\",\"l87Benefit6Body\":\"On a union job, safety isn't optional — it's guaranteed. You have a much better chance of going home in the same condition you left in.\",\"l87BannerTitle\":\"Hundreds of Positions Open Right Now.\",\"l87BannerSubtitle\":\"Don't leave it on the table. Your family is our family — let's get to work.\",\"l87VideoTitle\":\"See Our Union In Action\",\"l87VideoSubtitle\":\"Watch how we support our members through training, representation, and building a stronger community together.\",\"l87VideoCtaTitle\":\"Ready to start your career with Insulators Local 87?\",\"l87VideoCtaDescription\":\"Join a union that fights for you — steady work, elite training, real wages.\",\"l87VideoPlaylistLabel\":\"PLAYLIST\",\"l87VideoVideosLabel\":\"videos\",\"l87MaintenanceLabel\":\"THE NEXT 5–10 YEARS\",\"l87MaintenanceTitle\":\"The Work Is Here for Years to Come.\",\"l87MaintenanceBody\":\"In 38 years, tradespeople in this region have never seen it this busy. Central Texas is drawing in billions in investment, and Local 87 is right in the middle of it.\",\"l87MaintenanceBullet1\":\"Semiconductor fabrication plants and data centers from Samsung, Intel, AMD, and more across the Austin metro\",\"l87MaintenanceBullet2\":\"SpaceX's expanding campus infrastructure in the Bastrop and Central Texas corridor\",\"l87MaintenanceBullet3\":\"New manufacturing and industrial facilities along the full Austin–San Antonio corridor\",\"l87MaintenanceBullet4\":\"Commercial and infrastructure growth throughout South Texas, including Corpus Christi\",\"l87MaintenanceBullet5\":\"Ongoing maintenance contracts at completed facilities — steady work long after the build wraps\",\"l87MaintenanceBullet6\":\"Emerging LNG plant opportunities in South Texas adding to the long-term outlook\",\"l87MaintenanceCardTitle\":\"More Than a Boom\",\"l87MaintenanceCardBody\":\"Previous rounds of Central Texas construction — Samsung, AMD, Motorola in the '90s — brought in nearly 300 travelers at their peak. That work didn't just end. It turned into maintenance contracts that kept our members employed for years afterward.\",\"l87MaintenanceCardTag\":\"10+ YEARS OF STEADY MAINTENANCE WORK\",\"l87MaintenanceCardBody2\":\"That's the outlook for steady work in the Austin–San Antonio region. If you're thinking about making a move, now is the time.\",\"l87FamilyLabel\":\"YOUR FAMILY IS OUR FAMILY\",\"l87FamilyTitle\":\"You're Not Just an Employee.\",\"l87FamilyBody1\":\"Non-union workers are often out there on their own — no representation, paying out of pocket for coverage that union members get as part of the deal. When you join Local 87, that changes.\",\"l87FamilyBody2\":\"You join a brotherhood and a sisterhood. People who show up for each other on the job and off it. A union that advocates for your wages, your safety, and your future — not just today, but for your whole career.\",\"l87FamilyBody3\":\"Whether you're brand new to the trade or you've been in it for 20 years, Local 87 is ready to make you part of something bigger.\",\"l87FamilyBody3Bold\":\"Your family is our family.\",\"l87FamilyCard1Title\":\"Brotherhood \u0026 Sisterhood\",\"l87FamilyCard1Body\":\"A community that shows up for you\",\"l87FamilyCard2Title\":\"Career Growth\",\"l87FamilyCard2Body\":\"Training, advancement, and opportunity\",\"l87FamilyCard3Title\":\"Fair Representation\",\"l87FamilyCard3Body\":\"Someone always in your corner\",\"l87FamilyCard4Title\":\"Family Security\",\"l87FamilyCard4Body\":\"Benefits and wages that protect your future\",\"l87FooterTitle1\":\"Our Family Is\",\"l87FooterTitle2\":\"Your Family.\",\"l87FooterBody\":\"Reliable pay, real opportunity, and a union that puts you first — from your first day on the job to the day you retire. Central Texas needs skilled insulators. Come be part of something that lasts.\",\"l87FooterAffiliated\":\"Affiliated with\",\"l87FooterWebsite\":\"www.insulators.org\",\"l87FooterUnionName\":\"International Association of Heat \u0026 Frost Insulators and Allied Workers — Local 87\",\"l87FooterLocation\":\"Austin \u0026 San Antonio, Texas\",\"l87FooterAffiliatedLabel\":\"AFFILIATED WITH\",\"l87FooterAffiliatedLink\":\"IAHFIAW | insulators.org\",\"l87FooterTagline\":\"YOUR FAMILY IS OUR FAMILY\",\"l87FooterWebsiteBy\":\"Website by\",\"l87FooterLinkedUnion\":\"LinkedUnion\",\"l87FooterCopyright\":\"© 2024 International Association of Heat and Frost Insulators and Allied Workers. All rights reserved.\",\"l87FooterPrivacy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"l87FooterCookies\":\"Cookies Policy\",\"l87FooterContact\":\"Contact Us\",\"liveChat\":{\"greeting\":{\"heading\":\"Hey, how can I help?\",\"welcome\":\"Welcome to LinkedUnion! I'm here to help — just ask your question to get started.\"},\"quickAction\":{\"calculateWage\":\"Calculate my wage\",\"nextDues\":\"When is my next dues?\",\"contactAdmin\":\"Contact admin\",\"reportIssue\":\"Report an issue\",\"somethingElse\":\"Something else\"},\"input\":{\"placeholder\":\"Message LUIE…\",\"waiting\":\"Waiting for response...\",\"send\":\"Send\"},\"searching\":\"Searching your data...\",\"thinking\":\"Thinking\",\"options\":{\"endChat\":\"End this chat\",\"talkToAdmin\":\"Talk To An Admin\",\"search\":\"Search in this chat\",\"label\":\"Options\"},\"search\":{\"close\":\"Close search\",\"noMatches\":\"No messages match \\\"{query}\\\".\"},\"feedback\":{\"up\":\"Good response\",\"down\":\"Bad response\"},\"status\":{\"inProgress\":\"In Progress\",\"ended\":\"Ended\"},\"endedNotice\":{\"text\":\"This chat has been ended. If you wish to start a new chat please \",\"cta\":\"Click Here\"},\"wageResumeBlocked\":\"The Wage Calculator is turned off for your union, so this conversation is read-only.\",\"history\":{\"empty\":\"No past conversations yet.\",\"capReached\":\"Active chat limit reached — end or delete a chat to start a new one.\"},\"drawer\":{\"title\":\"Chat history\",\"close\":\"Close chat history\",\"newChat\":\"New chat\",\"previous\":\"Previous chats\",\"agent\":\"Agent\",\"support\":\"Support\"},\"endChat\":{\"title\":\"End Chat\",\"body\":\"Are you sure you want to end the chat?\",\"confirm\":\"End It\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\"},\"deleteChat\":{\"title\":\"Delete Chat\",\"body\":\"Permanently delete this conversation? This can’t be undone.\",\"bodyNamed\":\"Permanently delete this conversation? This can’t be undone.\",\"confirm\":\"Delete\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"deleting\":\"Deleting…\"},\"preChat\":{\"receiveNotifications\":\"Receive notifications via email\"},\"newChat\":{\"close\":\"Close new chat options\"},\"consent\":{\"body\":\"By starting a conversation, you agree to receive automated messages from LinkedUnion. View our \u003clink\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/link\u003e to learn how we handle your data.\",\"privacyPolicy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"accept\":\"I Accept\"},\"launcher\":{\"title\":\"Need help?\",\"subtitle\":\"Chat with us\",\"close\":\"Close chat\"},\"welcome\":{\"headingLead\":\"Hi, I'm\",\"headingSecondary\":\"Your personal AI assistant\",\"consent\":\"By getting started, you're agreeing to our friendly {link}.\",\"privacyLabel\":\"Privacy policy\",\"cta\":\"Get started\",\"poweredBy\":\"Powered by LinkedUnion\",\"headingAccent\":\"LUie\"},\"disclaimer\":\"LUIE is AI and can make mistakes.\",\"contactAdmin\":{\"unavailable\":\"No representative is available right now. Please try again later.\",\"failed\":\"Something went wrong. Please try again.\"}},\"wageCalculator\":{\"you\":\"You\",\"title\":\"Wage Calculator\",\"disclaimer\":\"Wage Calculator is AI and can make mistakes.\",\"launcher\":{\"open\":\"Open Wage Calculator\",\"close\":\"Close Wage Calculator\",\"title\":\"Wage Calculator\",\"subtitle\":\"Check your rate\"},\"greeting\":{\"heading\":\"Let's check your rate\",\"body\":\"Ask about pay under your contract. I use the rates your union has on file.\",\"bodyNamed\":\"Ask about pay under {union}'s contract. I use the rates your union has on file.\"},\"input\":{\"waiting\":\"Wage Calculator is replying…\",\"placeholder\":\"Ask about your wage\",\"send\":\"Send\",\"stop\":\"Stop\"},\"progress\":{\"working\":\"Checking your wage sheet…\",\"calculating\":\"Working out the numbers…\"},\"status\":{\"thinking\":\"Wage Calculator is thinking\",\"loading\":\"Working…\"},\"suggestion\":{\"classificationRate\":\"What does a journeyman make?\",\"listClassifications\":\"Which classifications do you have rates for?\",\"benefits\":\"What are the healthcare and pension contributions?\"},\"error\":{\"invalidQuestion\":\"That question was too short or too long. Please rephrase it.\",\"unauthorized\":\"Please sign in again to use the Wage Calculator.\",\"rateLimited\":\"Too many questions just now. Please wait a moment.\",\"generic\":\"Something went wrong. Please try again.\"},\"budgetWarning\":\"{pct}% of this month's assistant usage has been used.\",\"welcome\":{\"headingSecondary\":\"Your personal wage assistant\"},\"stopped\":\"You stopped this response\"},\"l69NavJoinToday\":\"Join Today\",\"l69JoinToday\":\"Join Today\",\"l69JoinUsToday\":\"Join Us Today\",\"l69HeroTag\":\"Local 69 — The Mountain West\",\"l69HeroTitle1\":\"The Mountain West Is\",\"l69HeroTitle2\":\"Hiring Mechanical Insulators\",\"l69HeroSubtitle\":\"Our family is your family/Nuestra familia es tu familia\",\"l69HeroDescription\":\"There is an unprecedented amount of work on the horizon for experienced insulators in our region. From massive data centers to one of the largest chip manufacturing projects in the country, Local 69 members are at the center of it all.\",\"l69Stat1Label\":\"Insulators Needed Now\",\"l69Stat2Label\":\"States, One Brotherhood\",\"l69Stat3Label\":\"Out-of-Pocket Training\",\"l69Stat4Label\":\"Defined Benefit Pension\",\"l69WhyLabel\":\"Why Local 69\",\"l69WhyTitle\":\"The Mountain West is booming.\",\"l69WhyBody1\":\"From the Treasure Valley in Idaho to the Wasatch Front in Utah, the high plains of Wyoming, the valleys of Nevada, and into Colorado, the Mountain West is in the middle of a construction surge that doesn't come around twice. Tech giants are planting roots across the region. Semiconductor manufacturing is expanding in ways these states have never seen. And the insulators who show up now will be the ones working for years to come.\",\"l69WhyBody2\":\"This means multiple contractors, multiple job sites, and a steady call-out sheet. You're not betting on one employer. You're plugging into a system built to keep you working.\",\"l69StateIdaho\":\"Idaho\",\"l69StateUtah\":\"Utah\",\"l69StateWyoming\":\"Wyoming\",\"l69StateNevada\":\"Nevada\",\"l69StateColorado\":\"Colorado\",\"l69Project1Eyebrow\":\"Largest Project\",\"l69Project1Title\":\"Micron Technology Chip Plant\",\"l69Project1Location\":\"Boise, ID\",\"l69Project1Body\":\"The largest single project on Local 69's horizon. Multi-phase construction with future expansion already planned. This is the kind of work that spans years, not months.\",\"l69Project2Eyebrow\":\"Data Centers\",\"l69Project2Title\":\"Google \u0026 Meta\",\"l69Project2Location\":\"Kuna, ID\",\"l69Project2Body\":\"Meta has completed a data center in Kuna with potential for additional phases. A Google data center is also on the horizon in the same corridor. More to come in this fast-growing market.\",\"l69Project3Eyebrow\":\"Active Construction\",\"l69Project3Title\":\"QTS Data Center\",\"l69Project3Location\":\"Utah\",\"l69Project3Body\":\"PCI and Boyter Brothers currently have the QTS data center under construction. Additional data center work is mapped in Wyoming and Delta, Utah, with more projects in development.\",\"l69Project4Eyebrow\":\"Coming Soon\",\"l69Project4Title\":\"Texas Instruments\",\"l69Project4Location\":\"Lehi, UT\",\"l69Project4Body\":\"Texas Instruments has work on the horizon in Lehi, adding to a growing pipeline of semiconductor and manufacturing projects throughout Utah.\",\"l69WhyBandTitle\":\"Multiple contractors. Multiple job sites. A steady call-out sheet.\",\"l69WhyBandSubtitle\":\"You're not betting on one employer — you're plugging into a system built to keep you working.\",\"l69BenefitsLabel\":\"Member Benefits\",\"l69BenefitsTitle\":\"More Than a Job. A Career Built to Last.\",\"l69BenefitsBody\":\"When you join Local 69, you're not just picking up your next paycheck. You're signing on to a system designed to protect you, pay you fairly, and take care of your family for the long haul.\",\"l69Benefit1Title\":\"Competitive Wages\",\"l69Benefit1Body\":\"Union scale pay that reflects the skill it takes to do the job right. No guessing, no negotiating on your own. Your wage is set and protected.\",\"l69Benefit2Title\":\"Health \u0026 Welfare\",\"l69Benefit2Body\":\"Comprehensive medical, dental, and vision coverage for you and your family. Your health is protected on and off the job.\",\"l69Benefit3Title\":\"Defined Benefit Pension\",\"l69Benefit3Body\":\"A retirement you don't have to figure out on your own. Contributions made on your behalf every hour you work, building a future you can count on.\",\"l69Benefit4Title\":\"Job Security \u0026 Steady Work\",\"l69Benefit4Body\":\"Multiple contractors, multiple job sites. When one project wraps, the dispatch hall keeps you moving. You're not dependent on any single employer.\",\"l69Benefit5Title\":\"Free Apprenticeship Training\",\"l69Benefit5Body\":\"World-class trade education at no cost to you. Whether you're sharpening your skills or learning something new, the training is there when you need it.\",\"l69Benefit6Title\":\"Safety First, Always\",\"l69Benefit6Body\":\"You go home the same way you came in. Union job sites have higher safety standards, and Local 69 members don't cut corners when it comes to protecting each other.\",\"l69SpotlightTitle\":\"200 Experienced Insulators Needed.\",\"l69SpotlightBody\":\"Call-outs are coming in groups of 30 to 40 at a time — and multiple contractors will be asking at once. The time to get into the queue is now.\",\"l69SpotlightImageAlt\":\"A Local 69 insulator cutting insulation board in the training shop\",\"l69OutlookLabel\":\"Work Outlook\",\"l69OutlookTitle\":\"The Work Keeps Coming In.\",\"l69OutlookBody\":\"Local 69's territory — spanning Idaho, Utah, Wyoming, Nevada, and Colorado — is one of the most active construction corridors in the West right now. These aren't rumors. The projects are mapped, the contractors are lined up, and the call-outs have already started.\",\"l69Outlook1Location\":\"Boise, ID\",\"l69Outlook1Title\":\"Micron Technology Chip Plant\",\"l69Outlook1Body\":\"The region's largest project, with multiple future phases already planned\",\"l69Outlook2Location\":\"Kuna, ID\",\"l69Outlook2Title\":\"Google \u0026 Meta Data Centers\",\"l69Outlook2Body\":\"Potential coming online as the corridor builds out\",\"l69Outlook3Location\":\"Utah\",\"l69Outlook3Title\":\"QTS Data Center\",\"l69Outlook3Body\":\"Currently under construction with PCI and Boyter Brothers\",\"l69Outlook4Location\":\"Lehi, UT\",\"l69Outlook4Title\":\"Texas Instruments Facility\",\"l69Outlook4Body\":\"Work on the horizon — plans mapped, contractors standing by\",\"l69Outlook5Location\":\"Kuna, ID\",\"l69Outlook5Title\":\"Meta Data Center\",\"l69Outlook5Body\":\"Recently completed, with additional phases possible\",\"l69Outlook6Location\":\"Wyoming \u0026 Delta, UT\",\"l69Outlook6Title\":\"Additional Data Center Activity\",\"l69Outlook6Body\":\"Growing corridor with more announcements expected\",\"l69FamilyLabel\":\"Our Community\",\"l69FamilyTitle\":\"Our Family Is Your Family.\",\"l69FamilyBody1\":\"Local 69 is a diverse, welcoming union. Doesn't matter where you come from, doesn't matter what you look like. If you do the work, you belong here. Our membership reflects the communities we work in — across Idaho, Utah, Wyoming, Nevada, Colorado, and everywhere in between.\",\"l69FamilyBody2\":\"We know that for many members, their families are everything. That's why union membership isn't just about the job. It's about building something stable enough that your family doesn't have to worry when work slows, when you get hurt, or when it's time to retire.\",\"l69FamilyBody3\":\"The job site should be a place where everyone can build a future. That's what Local 69 is working toward, every day.\",\"l69FamilyPhotoAlt\":\"A Local 69 member on site at sunset, with a parent lifting a child silhouetted behind her\",\"l69FamilyChip1Title\":\"Brotherhood \u0026 Inclusion\",\"l69FamilyChip2Title\":\"Respect \u0026 Safety\",\"l69FamilyChip3Title\":\"Opportunity \u0026 Family\",\"l69BuildingTitle\":\"Building Your Future Together\",\"l69BuildingBody1\":\"The Wasatch Valley, the Treasure Valley, the high plains of Wyoming, the valleys of Nevada, and the communities across Colorado — Local 69 members live and work in these places. They're not just passing through.\",\"l69BuildingBody2\":\"When you join Local 69, you're joining people who look out for each other. Experienced members bring in new ones. Veterans help newcomers find their footing. That's how the trade has always worked.\",\"l69BuildingBody3\":\"And with the volume of work coming to this region, there's room for a lot of people to build something real here.\",\"l69BuildingImageAlt\":\"A Local 69 insulator fitting cladding to a large pipe in a mechanical room\",\"l69VisitTitle1\":\"Our Family Is\",\"l69VisitTitle2\":\"Your Family\",\"l69VisitBody\":\"Local 69 is recruiting experienced insulators right now. The work is here, the wages are fair, and the brotherhood is real. Take the next step.\",\"l69FooterUnionName\":\"International Association of Heat \u0026 Frost Insulators and Allied Workers — Local 69\",\"l69FooterLocation\":\"The Mountain West\",\"l69FooterAffiliatedLabel\":\"Affiliated With\",\"l69FooterTagline\":\"Our family is your family\",\"l69FooterCopyright\":\"© 2026 International Association of Heat and Frost Insulators and Allied Workers. All rights reserved.\",\"l69FooterWebsiteBy\":\"Website by\",\"l69FooterLinkedUnion\":\"LinkedUnion\",\"l69FooterPrivacy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"l69FooterCookies\":\"Cookies Policy\",\"l69FooterContact\":\"Contact Us\",\"l69HeroDescriptionEmphasis\":\"If you've done the job, we want you.\",\"l69WhyTitleAccent\":\"The work is here.\",\"l69MapAllStates\":\"All states\",\"l69MapTablistLabel\":\"Choose a state to see county-level jurisdiction\",\"l69MapAllStatesAlt\":\"Map of the United States with Local 69's five jurisdiction states highlighted\",\"l69MapStateViewAlt\":\"County map showing which counties fall within Local 69's jurisdiction\",\"l69MapWithinJurisdiction\":\"Within jurisdiction\",\"l69MapOutsideJurisdiction\":\"Outside jurisdiction\",\"l69MapLoading\":\"Loading map\",\"l69SpotlightTitleAccent\":\"Are You One of Them?\",\"l69RegionTitle\":\"Work Across the Region\",\"l69RegionBody1\":\"Local 69 members work across a wide territory, which means no single project or contractor controls your livelihood. When one job wraps, another is starting. That’s the value of working union across five states.\",\"l69RegionBody2\":\"Local 69’s signatory contractors — including Boyter Brothers, Barracuda Mechanical Insulation, Louis A. Roser Company, and more — offer competitive wages and the full suite of Local 69 benefits and retirement. These are employers who invest in their people, because they know what a skilled insulator is worth.\",\"ChooseHowToPay\":\"Choose how to pay\",\"PayOneTime\":\"Pay one time\",\"PayOneTimeBlurb\":\"Pay for the months you choose, then you're done.\",\"SetUpSubscription\":\"Set up a subscription\",\"SetUpSubscriptionBlurb\":\"Charge my card automatically until I cancel.\",\"SubscriptionHidesMonthSliders\":\"Month sliders are hidden for a subscription. A subscription carries one cadence, chosen below — a per-line month count would contradict it.\",\"MonthlyRate\":\"Monthly rate\",\"RepeatThisPayment\":\"Repeat this payment automatically\",\"RepeatThisPaymentBlurb\":\"We'll charge the same card on a schedule so you don't have to remember.\",\"Monthly\":\"Monthly\",\"Quarterly\":\"Quarterly\",\"Annual\":\"Annual\",\"MonthlyCadenceBlurb\":\"1 month of dues, every month\",\"QuarterlyCadenceBlurb\":\"3 months, every 3 months\",\"AnnualCadenceBlurb\":\"12 months, once a year\",\"Cadence_monthly\":\"every month\",\"Cadence_quarterly\":\"every 3 months\",\"Cadence_annual\":\"once a year\",\"RecurringConsent\":\"I authorize {union} to ch