trades have seen in years. A wave of new data center and advanced manufacturing projects is bringing steady, long-term insulation work to the region, and Local 50 is staffing up to meet it.\",\"l50WorkCheck1\":\"Major semiconductor and advanced manufacturing construction ramping toward full crews through 2027\",\"l50WorkCheck2\":\"A growing pipeline of hyperscale data center projects across the Columbus and Dayton corridor\",\"l50WorkCheck3\":\"Steady industrial work at established sites in Circleville and across Central Ohio\",\"l50WorkCheck4\":\"Work you don't have to leave home for — stay with your family instead of chasing jobs out of state\",\"l50SeeTheBenefits\":\"See the Benefits\",\"l50WorkPhotoAlt\":\"Local 50 insulator fitting duct insulation in the training shop\",\"l50WorkCalloutTitle\":\"Hiring Outlook\",\"l50WorkCalloutBody\":\"50–70 Insulators expected on just one Central Ohio mega project by mid-2027\",\"l50BenefitsLabel\":\"What You Get\",\"l50BenefitsTitle\":\"Benefits that don't come out of your check.\",\"l50BenefitsBody\":\"Non-union insulators in Central Ohio are paying hundreds of dollars a week out of pocket for family health coverage, money that could be going toward retirement. Local 50 members don't make that trade-off.\",\"l50Benefit1Title\":\"Guaranteed Wage Increases\",\"l50Benefit1Body\":\"Contract wage and benefit increases negotiated on your behalf, not left to chance.\",\"l50Benefit2Title\":\"Medical, Dental \u0026 Vision\",\"l50Benefit2Body\":\"Full family health coverage with nothing deducted from your hourly wage.\",\"l50Benefit3Title\":\"Pension \u0026 Annuity\",\"l50Benefit3Body\":\"Employer-funded pension and annuity contributions on every hour you work, building real retirement security.\",\"l50Benefit4Title\":\"A Union That's Your Family\",\"l50Benefit4Body\":\"Local support from people who've worked the same tools, and a brotherhood that looks out for you and yours.\",\"l50Benefit5Title\":\"Paid Training (JTC Fund)\",\"l50B