y to leave a non-union job behind, we want to talk to you.\",\"l207Stat1Label\":\"Founded\",\"l207Stat2Label\":\"States Covered\",\"l207Stat3Label\":\"District Councils\",\"l207Stat4Label\":\"State Training Programs\",\"l207WorkLabel\":\"Why Local 207\",\"l207WorkTitle\":\"Work Is Picking Up Across the Region\",\"l207WorkBody\":\"Our contractors are growing and the work is steady. In the West Virginia district alone, Vac-Truck crews are averaging over 10,000 man-hours a month, with drivers logging around 250 hours themselves — and newer signatory contractors are opening up even more opportunity.\",\"l207WorkPhotoAlt\":\"Local 207 member insulating a duct in the training shop\",\"l207Work1Title\":\"Asbestos \u0026 Lead Abatement\",\"l207Work1Body\":\"Certified, state-licensed hazardous materials work with 20-state training programs behind you.\",\"l207Work2Title\":\"HAZMAT\",\"l207Work2Body\":\"Full hazardous material handling certification across commercial, industrial, and government sites.\",\"l207Work3Title\":\"Vac-Truck\",\"l207Work3Body\":\"Good people get trained up and get their CDL. Steady hours, dependable contractors, real pay.\",\"l207Work4Title\":\"Firestop\",\"l207Work4Body\":\"Growing demand across our territory for trained, dependable firestop professionals.\",\"l207BenefitsLabel\":\"What You Get\",\"l207BenefitsTitle\":\"Benefits Built for the Long Haul\",\"l207BenefitsBody\":\"No unfunded liability, no surprises — just a plan that covers you and your family whether you're on the job or between contracts.\",\"l207Benefit1Title\":\"Vacation Fund\",\"l207Benefit1Body\":\"Money is set aside from every check and paid out twice a year, with the option for early elective distributions when you need it.\",\"l207Benefit2Title\":\"Health Insurance\",\"l207Benefit2Body\":\"Hospital, medical, dental, vision, and prescription coverage, plus short-term disability and life insurance. Coverage begins after 435 hours in a qualifying period, and just 145 hours a month keeps it going.\",\"l207Benefit3Title\":\"Training \u0026 State Licensing\",\"l207Benefit3Body\":\"Ongoing asbestos, HAZMAT, and firestop certification classes held across the territory, so your license and your skills stay current.\",\"l207Benefit4Title\":\"Defined Contribution Pension\",\"l207Benefit4Body\":\"Every hour you work builds your own account. Employers carry no unfunded liability, so the plan stays strong, and members can choose self-directed investment options.\",\"l207VideoTitle\":\"See Our Union In Action\",\"l207VideoSubtitle\":\"Watch how we support our members through training, representation, and building a stronger community together.\",\"l207VideoPlaylistLabel\":\"PLAYLIST\",\"l207VideoVideosLabel\":\"videos\",\"l207VideoCtaTitle\":\"Ready to start your career with Insulators International?\",\"l207VideoCtaDescription\":\"Join a union that fights for you — steady work, elite training, real wages.\",\"l207VideoPrevious\":\"Previous video\",\"l207VideoNext\":\"Next video\",\"l207Video1Title\":\"Retirement and Pension\",\"l207Video2Title\":\"Work Environment\",\"l207Video3Title\":\"Personal Fulfillment\",\"l207Video4Title\":\"Financial Security\",\"l207Video5Title\":\"Magnitude of Work\",\"l207Video6Title\":\"Looking for a Career\",\"l207BannerTitle\":\"Tired of Chasing Whoever Pays the Most Next Week?\",\"l207BannerSubtitle\":\"Non-union vac-truck and back-truck work means bouncing between contractors with no real stability. Local 207 gives you consistent hours, real benefits, and a contractor base that's growing.\",\"l207RealMathLabel\":\"The Real Math\",\"l207RealMathTitle\":\"What Non-Union Really Costs You\",\"l207RealMathBody\":\"Watch how we support our members through training, representation, and building a stronger community together.\",\"l207RealMathUnion\":\"Local 207\",\"l207RealMathNonUnion\":\"Non-union\",\"l207RealMath1Title\":\"Health Coverage\",\"l207RealMath1Union\":\"Full family coverage with no premiums deducted from your pay check\",\"l207RealMath1NonUnion\":\"Coverage varies by employer and can be cut or dropped at any time\",\"l207RealMath2Title\":\"Pension\",\"l207RealMath2Union\":\"Defined contribution pension funded for every hour you work, guaranteed\",\"l207RealMath2NonUnion\":\"Rarely offered, and where it exists, the employer can change or cancel it\",\"l207RealMath3Title\":\"Job Stability\",\"l207RealMath3Union\":\"Steady contractor base backed by union referrals and seniority protection\",\"l207RealMath3NonUnion\":\"Pay for your own medical, dental \u0026 vision out of pocket\",\"l207RealMath4Title\":\"CDL/Training Support\",\"l207RealMath4Union\":\"Trained and upgraded on the job through structured union apprenticeship programs\",\"l207RealMath4NonUnion\":\"Training support is handled case by case, and often not offered at all\",\"l207RealMath5Title\":\"Vacation Fund\",\"l207RealMath5Union\":\"Guaranteed, portable vacation fund paid semi-annually\",\"l207RealMath5NonUnion\":\"Not typical — vacation time and pay are left to each employer's own policy\",\"l207CouncilsTitle\":\"Find Your District Council\",\"l207CouncilMichiganName\":\"Michigan District Council\",\"l207CouncilMichiganLocation\":\"Main Union Office — Taylor, MI\",\"l207CouncilOhioName\":\"Ohio District Council\",\"l207CouncilOhioLocation\":\"Dayton, OH\",\"l207CouncilWestVirginiaName\":\"West Virginia District Council\",\"l207CouncilWestVirginiaLocation\":\"New Haven, WV / Parkersburg Vac-Truck Region\",\"l207CouncilKentuckyName\":\"IIKT District Council\",\"l207CouncilKentuckyLocation\":\"Marion, KY\",\"l207CouncilMidwestName\":\"Midwest District Council\",\"l207CouncilMidwestLocation\":\"Bridgeton, MO / St. Louis \u0026 Kansas City Region\",\"l207FamilyLabel\":\"Who We Are\",\"l207FamilyTitle\":\"A Union That Treats You Like Family\",\"l207FamilyBody\":\"Since 1991, Local 207 has built a reputation on training, licensing, and standing behind our members, on the job and off. When you join, you're not just get